   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Pal Barnplan-emergency</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pal Children-emergency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till den palestinska barnplanen och dess &quot;emergency plan 2003-4. St&#xf6;d g&#xe5;r dels till barnsekretariatet inom PA som ansvarar f&#xf6;r bla policyutveckling och st&#xf6;d till involverade linjeministerier, dels till 4 projekt. M&#xe5;lgrupp f&#xf6;r dessa &#xe4;r funktionshindrade barn, f&#xe4;ngslade barn, arbetande och tiggande barn samt barn som pga konflikten lever under s&#xe4;rskilt marginaliserade f&#xf6;rh&#xe5;llanden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the National Plan of Action for Palestinian Children and the emergency plan 2003-4. Support is directedt to (I) Childrens Secretariat responsible for policy dev, follo-up and support to implementors of the projects and (II) to four projects. Target groups are disabled children, child detainees and children of detainees, child laborers and beggars, and marginalised children.</narrative>
  </description>
